      "title": {
        "en": "Loving attention for dogs and cats"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners express boundless trust in the daycare and boarding service, highlighting how pampered their pets feel during stays. Reviewers note that nervous dogs, rescue animals, and cats in the cattery receive individualized affection and calm companionship. Dogs return home happy, well-exercised, and eager for upcoming kennel visits."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 32,
      "title": {
        "en": "Passionate and attentive caregiving team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients warmly praise owner Katie, groomer Chrissy, and the entire team for treating companion animals like their own family. Pet parents highlight the staff's dedication when caring for post-surgery pets and senior animals with medical needs. Reviewers appreciate the accommodating service and peace of mind during family holidays."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "place",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 12,
      "title": {
        "en": "Expansive countryside facility with play areas"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers admire the countryside setting, frequently praising the large open fields, secure play zones, and comfortable boarding accommodations. Clients appreciate the separate cattery suites and dedicated social areas where dogs can socialize safely. The spacious, clean grounds provide a stimulated home away home."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
